cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "Lexical Diversity Trades Against Base-Coverage Retention in Teacherless Continual RLVR"
abstract: >-
  Code, per-cycle run logs, and analysis scripts for a measurement study of
  exploration-stability control levers in teacherless continual multi-domain
  RLVR, including a preregistered five-level entropy dose-response, a
  harvest-source ablation, and a three-seed operating-point comparison.
